    <td width="50%"><h5>Welcome To The Offical
      Home Page of PERMANEMUS</h5>
      <font size="2">
      So you may be interested in joining our fellowship? First,
      let me take a moment to tell you who we are and what we stand for. We are
      a guild that was formed among long time Faydwerian friends. We do respect
      all the peoples of Norrath and
      enjoy adventuring with them. We do wish that your desire to join us is
      sincere and that you are like of mind, therefore we require pledging our
      guild before you may
      bear our guild title proudly. We request that you read and fully
      understand the guild charters (both in and out of character). We will
      grant membership to our guild based upon your full understanding and
      acceptance of our charter and the following. For all new members there are
      some rules, regulations, and tactics one must follow.
      The rules and regulation part is very easy. As long as you follow the
      upcoming items, there should be no problem at all.</font>
      <p>
      <font size="2">
